  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Southern Border secluded cultivator Zheng Qing inherits one of Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable’s wood path inheritances through a fortuitous encounter.",
      "chapters": [
        1468
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As first supreme elder of Heavenly Lotus Sect, Chen Yi has Genesis Lotus’ true inheritance and can greatly interfere with Divine Bean Palace and influence it.",
      "chapters": [
        1522
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-lotus-holder",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect",
        "char_chen_yi",
        "house_divine_bean_palace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Thunder Ghost True Monarch names Chen Yi’s displayed power in the Lang Ya battle as the power of Genesis Lotus’ true inheritance, and as first supreme elder of Heavenly Lotus Sect and inheritor of Genesis Lotus’ true inheritance he shows extraordinary battle strength.",
      "chapters": [
        1574
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battle-display",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_thunder_ghost_true_monarch",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan judges ancient tree prison cage as showing the essence of Genesis Lotus true inheritance’s killer moves, like reverse flow protection seal; its outer layer is too thick and does not fear immortal killer moves, leaving him without a ready counter.",
      "chapters": [
        1575
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "killer-move-essence",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Long understands a wood path gift near Calamity Luck Altar as a Genesis Lotus true inheritance; memories of the killer move through branches and leaves etch into his mind, and its power frees a Gu Immortal of all harmful restraints.",
      "chapters": [
        1721
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "restraint-freeing-inheritance-gained",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long",
        "house_calamity_luck_altar",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Chen Yi inherits Genesis Lotus’ true inheritance many years earlier, a tall tree painting is engraved on his body; during the Infallible blessed land battle that painting awakens as Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable’s arrangement, enabling karma divine tree and consecutive karma relocation.",
      "chapters": [
        1740
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "karma-packages",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_infallible_blessed_land",
        "move_karma_divine_tree",
        "move_karma_relocation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In his youth Chen Yi obtained a Genesis Lotus true inheritance named Karma Divine Tree, and during the battle in Lang Ya blessed land he obtained another named Karma Relocation; after searching Chen Yi’s soul, Fang Yuan obtains those two Genesis Lotus true inheritances.",
      "chapters": [
        1771
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "two-packages",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lu Wei Yin tells Ye Fan that Genesis Lotus’ true inheritance has extremely high value and is divided into three parts: contented lifestyle killer move, the luck of being the child of humanity, and the rank eight Immortal Gu House formed from Divine Bean Palace and Emperor City, Divine Emperor Palace. He plans to take the child of humanity part first, then borrow Fang Yuan’s strength toward the first part or even the third.",
      "chapters": [
        1947
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "three-part-fortune",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lu_wei_yin",
        "char_ye_fan",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "loc_emperor_city",
        "house_divine_emperor_palace"
      ]
    }
  ],
